{"id":82,"title":"Linux安装Python","summary":"本课是一个关于如何在Linux环境下安装Python的教程。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b246fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"每个操作系统的安装过程都略有不同。本课是一个在 Linux 上安装 Python 的指南。如果你不是用Linux，可以跳过本教程。\n\n## Linux中的Python\n\n许多Linux发行版都预装了Python的版本。较老的发行版可能有Python 2.7，而较新的发行版可能配备了最新的版本。然而，你还是需要确认下安装的Python是否为最新的版本。\n\n下面，介绍Linux 机器安装了最新的 Python 的不同方法。为了简单起见，我们将展示**Ubuntu**的安装过程。\n\n### 检查版本\n\n第一步应该是检查是否已经安装了Python或Python3的版本。 为此，只需进入终端并输入以下命令：\n\n#### Python2","text_html":"<p>每个操作系统的安装过程都略有不同。本课是一个在 Linux 上安装 Python 的指南。如果你不是用Linux，可以跳过本教程。</p>\n<h2>Linux中的Python</h2>\n<p>许多Linux发行版都预装了Python的版本。较老的发行版可能有Python 2.7，而较新的发行版可能配备了最新的版本。然而，你还是需要确认下安装的Python是否为最新的版本。</p>\n<p>下面，介绍Linux 机器安装了最新的 Python 的不同方法。为了简单起见，我们将展示<strong>Ubuntu</strong>的安装过程。</p>\n<h3>检查版本</h3>\n<p>第一步应该是检查是否已经安装了Python或Python3的版本。 为此，只需进入终端并输入以下命令：</p>\n<h4>Python2</h4>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b412fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"python --version","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b476fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"#### Python3","text_html":"<h4>Python3</h4>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b4bcfb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"python3 --version","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b4f8fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"如果系统没有Python3的发行版，那就需要继续安装Python3。\n\n## 1. 使用PPA资源库\n\n这是一种在我们的机器上设置 Python 的快速方法。它还能确保将来的自动版本更新。\n\n使用PPA的第三方软件库，需要先运行以下命令来安装所有需要的资源库依赖：","text_html":"<p>如果系统没有Python3的发行版，那就需要继续安装Python3。</p>\n<h2>1. 使用PPA资源库</h2>\n<p>这是一种在我们的机器上设置 Python 的快速方法。它还能确保将来的自动版本更新。</p>\n<p>使用PPA的第三方软件库，需要先运行以下命令来安装所有需要的资源库依赖：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b534fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"sudo apt update\nsudo apt install software-properties-common\nsudo add-apt-repository ppa:deadsnakes/ppa","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b570fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"剩下的就是下载Python3的最新版本，也就是Python3.7：","text_html":"<p>剩下的就是下载Python3的最新版本，也就是Python3.7：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b5a2fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"sudo apt update\nsudo apt install python3.7","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b5defb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"现在就可以开始了!使用`python3.7 --version`来确认版本。\n\n## 2. 使用官方网站\n\n访问[Python官方下载页面](https://www.python.org/downloads/)，选择最新版本：","text_html":"<p>现在就可以开始了!使用<code>python3.7 --version</code>来确认版本。</p>\n<h2>2. 使用官方网站</h2>\n<p>访问<a href=\"https://www.python.org/downloads/\">Python官方下载页面</a>，选择最新版本：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b61afb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","image_id":5153424158490624,"file":"/content/assets/d798aea86003117d400b.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":2342,"height":698,"size_in_bytes":188296,"name":"5649821367009280.png"},"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b64cfb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"我们将被引导到该版本的相应页面，在该页面的底部将有一个**Files**部分：","text_html":"<p>我们将被引导到该版本的相应页面，在该页面的底部将有一个<strong>Files</strong>部分：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":10},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b688fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","image_id":5391009669709824,"file":"/content/assets/61b2b0863f05384cd2c8.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":2442,"height":996,"size_in_bytes":361150,"name":"5287399410106368.png"},"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b6bafb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"选择**XZ compressed source tarball**，开始下载安装文件。\n\n同时，我们将使用以下命令逐行安装Python所需的依赖包：","text_html":"<p>选择<strong>XZ compressed source tarball</strong>，开始下载安装文件。</p>\n<p>同时，我们将使用以下命令逐行安装Python所需的依赖包：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":12},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b6f6fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"sudo apt update\n\nsudo apt install build-essential zlib1g-dev libncurses5-dev libgdbm-dev libnss3-dev libssl-dev libreadline-dev libffi-dev wget","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":13},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b728fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"现在，把下载的Python安装文件复制到`usr/src`目录下，然后移到`/user/src`目录：","text_html":"<p>现在，把下载的Python安装文件复制到<code>usr/src</code>目录下，然后移到<code>/user/src</code>目录：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":14},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b764fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"sudo cp ~/Downloads/Python-3.7.3.tar.xz /usr/src\ncd /usr/src","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":15},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b796fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"我们解开压缩文件并进入其目录：","text_html":"<p>我们解开压缩文件并进入其目录：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":16},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b7d2fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"tar -xf Python-3.7.3.tar.xz\ncd Python-3.7.3","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":17},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b804fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"接下来，要设置安装的配置。最后，只需要使用`make altinstall`命令来安装Python。输入以下命令：","text_html":"<p>接下来，要设置安装的配置。最后，只需要使用<code>make altinstall</code>命令来安装Python。输入以下命令：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":18},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b840fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"shell","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.sh","content":"./configure --enable-optimizations\nsudo make altinstall","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":19},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a983b872fb4611eb89eb3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"就这样，我们拥有了它!\n\nPython3已经可以在机器上使用了。使用`python3.7 --version`来检查版本。\n\n## 3. 使用Anaconda（简单）\n\nAnaconda是一个非常流行的开源数据科学平台，开箱就配备了Python3。此外，许多Python3库和包都已经预装了。\n\n对于刚接触shell和终端命令的初学者来说，这无疑是最好的方法。\n\n设置相当简单。访问[官方下载页面](https://www.anaconda.com/distribution/)，选择Linux的安装程序（图形和命令行安装程序均可使用）。\n\n安装后，我们可以简单地在终端输入`python`来运行Python。这将显示我们正在运行的版本，并使我们进入Python环境。现在不用担心其他问题。使用`quit()`退出Python shell。\n\n---\n\n这些是我们在 Linux 机器上安装 Python3 的所有不同方法。希望一切都很顺利。如果你有任何问题，请与我们联系!\n\n在下一课，我们将学习如何为 Windows 安装设置 Python。","text_html":"<p>就这样，我们拥有了它!</p>\n<p>Python3已经可以在机器上使用了。使用<code>python3.7 --version</code>来检查版本。</p>\n<h2>3. 使用Anaconda（简单）</h2>\n<p>Anaconda是一个非常流行的开源数据科学平台，开箱就配备了Python3。此外，许多Python3库和包都已经预装了。</p>\n<p>对于刚接触shell和终端命令的初学者来说，这无疑是最好的方法。</p>\n<p>设置相当简单。访问<a href=\"https://www.anaconda.com/distribution/\">官方下载页面</a>，选择Linux的安装程序（图形和命令行安装程序均可使用）。</p>\n<p>安装后，我们可以简单地在终端输入<code>python</code>来运行Python。这将显示我们正在运行的版本，并使我们进入Python环境。现在不用担心其他问题。使用<code>quit()</code>退出Python shell。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这些是我们在 Linux 机器上安装 Python3 的所有不同方法。希望一切都很顺利。如果你有任何问题，请与我们联系!</p>\n<p>在下一课，我们将学习如何为 Windows 安装设置 Python。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":20}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/82"}
